<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Daniel Venture | Business Solutions</title>
<style>
  *{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;font-family: 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif}
  body{background:#ffffff;color:#222}
  header{background:#0a1931;color:white;padding:20px 8%;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;position:sticky;top:0}
  header h1{letter-spacing:1px} header h1 span{color:#ffb703}
  header nav a{color:white;text-decoration:none;margin-left:20px;font-weight:600}
  .hero{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0a1931,#185adb);color:white;padding:90px 8%;text-align:center}
  .hero h2{font-size:42px;margin-bottom:15px;line-height:1.2}
  .hero p{font-size:18px;opacity:0.9;margin-bottom:30px;max-width:600px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto}
  .btn{padding:14px 32px;background:#ffb703;color:#0a1931;border:none;border-radius:30px;font-weight:bold;font-size:16px;cursor:pointer}
  .section-title{text-align:center;padding:60px 8% 20px;font-size:28px;color:#0a1931}
  .services{padding:20px 8% 60px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(250px,1fr));gap:25px}
  .card{border:1px solid #eee;padding:30px;border-radius:15px;text-align:center;transition:0.3s}
  .card:hover{box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);transform:translateY(-5px)}
  .card h3{margin:15px 0 10px;color:#0a1931}
  .about{padding:50px 8%;background:#f5f7fb;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:30px;align-items:center}
  .about div{flex:1;min-width:280px}
  .contact{background:#0a1931;color:white;padding:60px 8%;text-align:center}
  .contact input{padding:14px;width:90%;max-width:400px;margin:8px 0;border-radius:8px;border:none}
  footer{text-align:center;padding:20px;background:#000;color:#aaa;font-size:14px}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <h1>DANIEL<span>VENTURE</span></h1>
  <nav>
    <a href="#services">Services</a>
    <a href="#about">About</a>
    <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
  </nav>
</header>

<section class="hero">
  <h2>Building Brands That Stand Out</h2>
  <p>Daniel Venture is your trusted partner for business growth, branding, and digital solutions in Port Harcourt and beyond.</p>
  <button class="btn" onclick="document.getElementById('contact').scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth'})">Work With Us</button>
</section>

<h2 class="section-title">What We Do</h2>
<section id="services" class="services">
  <div class="card">
    <h2>💼</h2>
    <h3>Business Consulting</h3>
    <p>We help you start, structure and scale your business the right way.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="card">
    <h2>🎨</h2>
    <h3>Branding & Design</h3>
    <p>Professional logos, flyers, and brand identity for Daniel Venture clients.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="card">
    <h2>🌐</h2>
    <h3>Web Development</h3>
    <p>Modern, fast, and mobile-ready websites that bring you customers.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="about" class="about">
  <div>
    <h2 style="color:#0a1931;margin-bottom:15px">About Daniel Venture</h2>
    <p>We are a Port Harcourt-based business committed to excellence, creativity, and results. At Daniel Venture, we don't just offer services — we offer growth. Whether you are a startup or an established brand, we provide solutions that work.</p>
    <br>
    <p><b>Location:</b> Port Harcourt, Rivers State<br><b>Core Values:</b> Integrity, Innovation, Impact</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background:#0a1931;color:white;padding:30px;border-radius:15px;text-align:center">
    <h3 style="color:#ffb703">Why Choose Us?</h3>
    <p style="margin-top:10px">✓ Trusted by local businesses<br>✓ Affordable & Professional<br>✓ Fast Delivery & Support</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="contact" class="contact">
  <h2>Let's Talk Business</h2>
  <p style="margin:15px 0;opacity:0.8">Fill the form and we will reach out today.</p>
  <input type="text" id="name" placeholder="Your Full Name"><br>
  <input type="text" id="phone" placeholder="WhatsApp Number"><br>
  <button class="btn" onclick="send()">Send Message</button>
</section>

<footer>© 2026 Daniel Venture. All Rights Reserved.</footer>

<script>
function send(){
  let name = document.getElementById("name").value;
  if(name==""){alert("Please enter your name, boss");return;}
  alert("Thank you " + name + "! Daniel Venture will contact you shortly. Welcome aboard!");
}
</script>
</body>
</html>
